z3-pl|Zelda 3 (Polish)
z3-pt|Zelda 3 (Portuguese)
z3-nl|Zelda 3 (Dutch)
z3-sv|Zelda 3 (Swedish)'

HASH_Z3_US=6D4F10A8B10E10DBE624CB23CF03B88BB8252973
HASH_Z3_REDUX=B2A07A59E64C498BC1B2F28728F9BF4014C8D582
